# A pin deliberately left stale, for _test-update-direnv-dependencies.yml. The test
# upgrades it in dry-run mode and asserts what the workflow reported back to its caller.
#
# DO NOT REFRESH THE PIN BELOW. A fixture pinned to the latest version would make the
# whole test pass by having nothing to upgrade - the assertion that `changed` is true
# would then be asserting nothing. The assertions name 0.40.0, so changing it here breaks
# them.
#
# No pixi workspace accompanies it on purpose: update-direnv-dependencies.yml never
# evaluates the .envrc, so the directive is the only thing that has to be here.
use pixi 0.40.0
